<title>USA: Bryan, Texas $1.500 mln won by A.G. Edwards.</title>
<headline>Bryan, Texas $1.500 mln won by A.G. Edwards.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-04-08</dateline>
<text>
<p>A.G. Edwards &amp; Sons said it won $1.500 million of Bryan, Texas, limited tax notes, Series 1997 A, with a true interest cost of 4.87 percent.</p>
</text>
